{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense of Egypt: Cleopatra Mission takes you to a land where the desert wind carries the sound of war. Under the burning sun and the gaze of the gods, every stone tower and bronze weapon becomes a shield for your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/extras/123875e6ae1275ad4bcced8855cc272a.avif?t=1764923340\" width=744 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across sixty missions you will fight on shifting dunes, riverbanks, and sacred temples. Sixteen enemy types march against you: infantry charging the gates, war machines grinding forward, raiders from the skies and ships rising from the Nile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have six kinds of towers to build and upgrade, each with its own strength. Five special mechanisms can twist their power even further, turning a simple defense into a deadly machine. And when the horde presses too close, you can intervene yourself: call down lightning, hurl grenades, or scatter deadly traps to break the assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a choice: do you play carefully, testing every path, or strike boldly and risk it all? The world of Ancient Egypt gives familiar tower defense mechanics a vivid tone\u2014sun, sand, stone, and steel.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/534010?t=1764923340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764923340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764923340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/534010/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764923340","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de